---
---
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="text-center w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-24 pt-32 relative z-10 px-4 md:px-0">
  <div 
    data-animate="hero"
    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full badge-glow text-xs text-gray-700 mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm"
  >
    <span class="text-primary material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">auto_awesome</span>
    Nuevo: Inteligencia Jurídica 2.0
  </div>
  <h1 
    data-animate="hero"
    class="font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl text-gray-900 mb-6 font-bold tracking-tighter leading-tight"
  >
    La inteligencia artificial para la jurisprudencia ecuatoriana.
  </h1>
  <p 
    data-animate="hero"
    class="font-body-lg text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
  >
    Accede a miles de sentencias de juzgados ecuatorianos organizadas con inteligencia artificial. Busca por problema jurídico y obtén resultados relevantes en segundos, no en días.
  </p>
  
  <!-- Search Feature -->
  <div 
    data-animate="hero"
    class="relative w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto glass-search rounded-2xl p-2 flex items-center mb-6 backdrop-blur-xl"
  >
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gray-500 ml-4 mr-3" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0;">search</span>
    <input 
      class="w-full bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0 text-gray-900 placeholder-gray-500 outline-none py-3 text-lg" 
      placeholder="Ej. Hábeas corpus por detención arbitraria..." 
      type="text"
      aria-label="Buscar jurisprudencia ecuatoriana"
    />
    <button class="bg-primary text-white font-medium text-sm px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors ml-2 whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer">
      Buscar
    </button>
  </div>

  <div 
    data-animate="hero"
    class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 mt-12 border-t border-black/5 pt-8"
  >
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-1">10M+</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Sentencias</div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-1">&lt; 1s</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Respuesta</div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-1">99.9%</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Precisión</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
